  "note_claim": "The video shows US Air Force C-17 Globemaster IIIs airdropping aid, not Chinese planes.",
  "label": "SUPPORTS",
  "quote": "Investigations into the footage reveal that most of the clips circulating online actually show a United States aid airdrop over Beit Lahiya, northern Gaza, from March 2024.",
  "reason": "The article explicitly identifies the footage as a US C-17 airdrop and states China does not operate this aircraft."
